        "observed": "Actually inspected upper west facade photograph. Gray brick,pale projecting cornices/pilasters and carved plaques;three domed towers with higher square central paired-louver stage and lower polygonal side towers. Faceted domes,small lanterns and crosses,central circular drum window and large facade rose with cross-shaped tracery. Paired side lights and dense pale geometric relief. Ground/doors/long roof are outside this close crop."
