        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0 (or listed earlier versions/GFDL1.2+)",
        "observed": "Actually inspected close side elevation. Tall recessed round-headed stained-glass windows,gray-brick planar walls,projecting stepped buttress-pilasters and strong cornice/parapet. Exact glass artwork,drains and small brick dentils omitted or simplified. Side crop does not establish hidden roof or rear partitions."
      }
